You try to bite off your foe with your ''head'' for [50%, 76%, 107%, 130%, 150% (STR 10-100; DEX 10-100; MAG 10-100; CON 10-100)] blight weapon damage.

If the target falls under 20% life you have [20%, 33%, 48%, 60%, 70% (STR 10-100; DEX 10-100; MAG 10-100; CON 10-100)] chances to outright kill it (bosses are immune).

Whenever you succesfully bite a foe you regenerate [3.0, 8.9, 16, 21, 25 (STR 10-100; DEX 10-100; MAG 10-100; CON 10-100)] life per turn for 5 turns.

Instant kill chances and regeneration increase with your Constitution stat and weapon damage increases with the highest of your Strength, Dexterity or Magic stat.
